-- seed.sql — demo data for a dev database.
--
-- Two academies on purpose. NRIFA is the demo; Ravens FC exists so the
-- isolation test in scripts/test-rls.sql has something to fail to see.
--
-- Channels are NOT seeded: creating an academy, a team or a member fires the
-- cascade in 0005, so loading this file also exercises it.

begin;

